{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/algorithm/LEET/L3006FindBeautifulIndicesintheGivenArrayI/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"frontmatter":{"title":"3006. Find Beautiful Indices in the Given Array I","date":"December 10, 2025"},"html":"<h1>문제 설명</h1>\n<p>이 문제는 다음 조건을 만족하는 아름다운 인덱스의 개수를 찾는 문제입니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>0 &#x3C;= i &#x3C;= s.length - a.length</li>\n<li>s[i..(i + a.length - 1)] == a</li>\n<li>There exists an index j such that:\n<ul>\n<li>0 &#x3C;= j &#x3C;= s.length - b.length</li>\n<li>s[j..(j + b.length - 1)] == b</li>\n<li>|j - i| &#x3C;= k</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>즉, 아름다운 조건은 다음과 같다:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>인덱스 i에서 시작하는 부분 배열이 a와 일치해야 한다.</li>\n<li>인덱스 j에서 시작하는 부분 배열이 b와 일치해야 한다.</li>\n<li>인덱스 i와 j 사이의 거리가 k 이하이어야 한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 47.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"3006\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/cadcfc6a99cd9e8415362ff225fbca71/5a190/3006.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/cadcfc6a99cd9e8415362ff225fbca71/772e8/3006.png 200w,\n/static/cadcfc6a99cd9e8415362ff225fbca71/e17e5/3006.png 400w,\n/static/cadcfc6a99cd9e8415362ff225fbca71/5a190/3006.png 800w,\n/static/cadcfc6a99cd9e8415362ff225fbca71/c1b63/3006.png 1200w,\n/static/cadcfc6a99cd9e8415362ff225fbca71/9f9a4/3006.png 1560w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h2>풀이 및 해설</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>이 문제를 풀기 위해서는 저는 다음과 같이 접근했습니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>배열 s를 순회하며 부분 배열이 a와 일치하는 모든 시작 인덱스를 찾고, b와 일치하는 모든 시작 인덱스를 찾습니다.</li>\n<li>이중 for문을 사용하여 a와 b의 시작 인덱스 쌍을 비교하고, |j - i| &#x3C;= k 조건을 만족하는지 확인합니다.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>이렇게 했을 때 풀리기는 하지만 시간 복잡도가 O(N^2)으로 비효율적일 수 있습니다.</p>\n<h2>풀이 1</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">class Solution:\n    def beautifulIndices(self, s: str, a: str, b: str, k: int) -> List[int]:\n        na, nb = len(a), len(b)\n        a_indices = []\n        b_indices = []\n\n        for i in range(len(s)):\n            # find indexes of occurrences str a\n            if i+na&#x3C;=len(s) and s[i:i+na]==a:\n                a_indices.append(i)\n\n            # find indexes of occurrences str b\n            if i+nb&#x3C;=len(s) and s[i:i+nb]==b:\n                b_indices.append(i)\n        \n        ans = []\n        for i in a_indices:\n            for j in b_indices:\n                if abs(j-i) &#x3C;= k:\n                    ans.append(i)\n                    break\n        \n        return ans\n</code></pre>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 44.99999999999999%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"tc-bad\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/0739ccada7f91b7c3cbdb5194f5b11ee/5a190/tc-bad.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/0739ccada7f91b7c3cbdb5194f5b11ee/772e8/tc-bad.png 200w,\n/static/0739ccada7f91b7c3cbdb5194f5b11ee/e17e5/tc-bad.png 400w,\n/static/0739ccada7f91b7c3cbdb5194f5b11ee/5a190/tc-bad.png 800w,\n/static/0739ccada7f91b7c3cbdb5194f5b11ee/c1b63/tc-bad.png 1200w,\n/static/0739ccada7f91b7c3cbdb5194f5b11ee/29007/tc-bad.png 1600w,\n/static/0739ccada7f91b7c3cbdb5194f5b11ee/e92cd/tc-bad.png 1778w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p>따라서, 두번째 부분의 이중 for문을 대신하여 bisect를 쓰면 O(N)을 O(N log N)으로 줄일 수 있습니다.</p>\n<h2>풀이 2 - Bisect 활용</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">class Solution:\n    def beautifulIndices(self, s: str, a: str, b: str, k: int) -> List[int]:\n        na, nb = len(a), len(b)\n        a_indices = []\n        b_indices = []\n\n        for i in range(len(s)):\n            # find indexes of occurrences str a\n            if i+na&#x3C;=len(s) and s[i:i+na]==a:\n                a_indices.append(i)\n\n            # find indexes of occurrences str b\n            if i+nb&#x3C;=len(s) and s[i:i+nb]==b:\n                b_indices.append(i)\n        \n        ans = []\n        for i in a_indices:\n            for j in b_indices:\n                if abs(j-i) &#x3C;= k:\n                    ans.append(i)\n                    break\n        \n        return ans\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Complexity Analysis</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 53.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"tc\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/73380cf8cc299593682eb5994e512df7/5a190/tc.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/73380cf8cc299593682eb5994e512df7/772e8/tc.png 200w,\n/static/73380cf8cc299593682eb5994e512df7/e17e5/tc.png 400w,\n/static/73380cf8cc299593682eb5994e512df7/5a190/tc.png 800w,\n/static/73380cf8cc299593682eb5994e512df7/c1b63/tc.png 1200w,\n/static/73380cf8cc299593682eb5994e512df7/2215f/tc.png 1548w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h3>시간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(N log N): 배열 s를 한 번 순회하는데 O(N)이 걸리고, bisect를 사용하여 각 a의 인덱스에 대해 b의 인덱스를 찾는 데 O(log N)이 걸리기 때문입니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>공간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(N): a와 b의 시작 인덱스를 저장하는 데 추가 공간이 필요하기 때문입니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Constraint Analysis</h2>\n<pre><code>Constraints:\n1 &#x3C;= k &#x3C;= s.length &#x3C;= 10^5\n1 &#x3C;= a.length, b.length &#x3C;= 10\ns, a, and b contain only lowercase English letters.\n</code></pre>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/find-beautiful-indices-in-the-given-array-i/\">3006. Find Beautiful Indices in the Given Array I - LeetCode</a></li>\n</ul>"}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/algorithm/LEET/L3006FindBeautifulIndicesintheGivenArrayI/"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}